+   /* Make host-visible memory shareable with the virtio-gpu blob transport.
+    * VK_EXT_external_memory_host supplies the direct import path on unified-memory
+    * hosts; dma-buf/opaque-fd export and GBM remain the native Linux paths.
     *
     * Most VkImage and VkBuffer are non-external while most VkDeviceMemory are external
     * if allocated with a host visible memory type. We still violate the spec by binding
-    * external memory to non-external image or buffer, which needs spec changes with a
-    * new extension.
+    * external memory to non-external image or buffer on the fd paths, which needs spec
